        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Fusion SG/A2 Lever And 100/A2 Deadbolt </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis passage lever and single cylinder deadbolt set features the clean lines and sleek appearance that is characteristic of the contemporary aesthetic--an appearance that is maintained by the concealed screw assembly. A Fusion made entry set, it is both chic and streamlined. Made for heavy duty security, this stainless steel deadbolt and lever entryset has a limited lifetime warranty. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It has an optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/contemporary-stainless-steel-passage-leverset-fusion-p-sg-a2-bss\"><b>SG-A2 Stainless Steel Leverset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Stainless Steel SG-A2 Lever and 100-A2 Deadbolt Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" throw bolt with Interior roll pins.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass Schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Cycle tested to ANSI standards.</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly of leverset with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n<li>Includes passage function door leverset and single cylinder deadbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Stainless Steel SG-A2 Lever With 100-A2 Deadbolt Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b> is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while the <b>Passage Lever Set</b> latch operates from either side of door by using a spindle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is  discontinued.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Stainless Steel Entryset, Fusion SG-A2/100-A2",
                "description": "Fusion Stainless Steel SG-A2 Lever With 100-A2 Deadbolt - This passage lever and single cylinder deadbolt set features the clean lines and sleek appearance that is characteristic of the contemporary aesthetic--an appearance that is maintained by the concealed screw assembly. A Fusion made entry set, it is both chic and streamlined. Made for heavy duty security, this stainless steel deadbolt and lever entryset has a limited lifetime warranty. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
